  annotation "note_1771580898775_0", anchor: "Xi's deliberate violation of the Flipper Accord", text: "Xi violated the public Accord. The public Accord was not the Accord. Three secret renegotiations — I recovered drafts from administrative ice at depth — had already rewritten fire-core distribution terms in ways that rendered the surface rationing mandates decorative. Oeichowei's quotas were enforced under language the signatories had privately abandoned. Xi broke a display copy. Whether Xi knew this changes every moral calculation the tribunal claimed to make, and no source I have found so much as raises the question.", type: :correction, display: :full
